Minnal Synthetic_Grid — Open Database License (ODbL) notice
===========================================================

The Minnal Synthetic_Grid (the GeoJSON data under `data/grid/`,
`data/facilities/` and `data/crews/`) is a **database adapted from
OpenStreetMap**. Substation and critical-facility locations are derived from a
trimmed OpenStreetMap extract; the radial network (feeders, laterals,
distribution transformers and service areas), customer counts and crews are
synthetic and generated by the Minnal replay simulator.

Because it is a produced database adapted from OpenStreetMap, this Synthetic_Grid
is distributed under the **Open Database License (ODbL) v1.0**.

